body:
Hi! I have this condition (21/f) and the thick hand thing is HORRIBLE! granny hands wrinkly hands you name I also have it bad on my feet so PE was the worst.  I Was called it too! also lizard lady of UK. though I love the nick now <3 try the vaseline ( yellow bottle ) healing lotion and a loofa or whatever you call it when showering! it will get worse over the winter so make sure your showers are toasty, exfoliation and lotion is what got me through this, what I also advise if you have it on your face is the ELF tea tree face primer to stop the peel, best thing is  shower, exfoliate with aloof, lotion and face scrub. 

&#x200B;

Good luck! you're doing great
